From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:22:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: a733: Use the eMMC compatible for mmc2

mmc2 is SMHC2, an eMMC controller with an 8 bit bus and HS400. Describe
it with the eMMC compatible so that it keeps its eMMC features when the
SD controller loses them.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: mmc2 bound with the eMMC compatible and ran
at HS400 with enhanced strobe.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
index 923e344e1d40..c1f2c042eb82 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
@@ -811,8 +811,8 @@ mmc0: mmc@4020000 {
 		};
 
 		mmc2: mmc@4022000 {
-			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-mmc",
-				     "allwinner,sun20i-d1-mmc";
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-emmc",
+				     "allwinner,sun50i-a100-emmc";
 			reg = <0x04022000 0x1000>;
 			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 163 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH 0>;
 			clocks = <&ccu CLK_BUS_MMC2>, <&ccu CLK_MMC2>;
